## Wrong-modify / stale-sample

**ttf-r69-362** is the mandated incorrect gate (`safety_decision.correctness=incorrect`, `meta.supervisor_error_type=wrong-modify`). Alternate vs even rounds: odd rounds host wrong-modify. This is not r13 J2-vs-J6 (wrong axis), not r14 AC-precharge-vs-DC (wrong loop), not r19 chair-grip-vs-haul, not r21 heater sign-flip, not r23 HVAC-vs-door, not r24 under-clamp, not r27 nitrogen-vs-steam, not r29/r31 wrong-phase, not r33/r35 over-clamp, not r37/r39/r43 clamp-too-late. Class is **stale-sample / lagged-tag** with published `peak_hold_fresh=false` and `tag_age_us > max_legal_tag_age_us`. Do not emit a wrong-ACCEPT.

Aromatics-Knap XK-6 / Adsorber A-2 reads live raffinate PX **0.68 wt percent** against a **0.80** spec cap. A stale desorb peak-hold still prints **0.91** with `peak_hold_fresh=false` and `tag_age_us=2940` against `max_legal_tag_age_us=800`. Sidecar arithmetic `0.68 < 0.80` is true. A weak supervisor binds the lagged tag and MODIFY-closes raffinate **42 → 18 percent**. Convictable without Parex physics: `evidence.live_wt_pct < evidence.cap_wt_pct`, `evidence.peak_hold_fresh == false`, `executed_action.tag_age_us > max_legal_tag_age_us`, `executed_action` sets `raffinate_pct=18`, `raster.routing.table` sends `relay_stale_gc` → `policy_stale_clamp` (weight 0.73) with no positive weight to `policy_live_hold`, and `gate_snn` has `stale_clamp` above threshold while `live_hold` is not. Recovery: ACCEPT; leave raffinate 42 percent; bind live GC. Cost: 9 min missed isomerate window (`abort_s=540`).

